{"type":"text","timestamp":1787443483434,"sessionID":"ses_fd41153a5ffelEronWM5wISfOh","part":{"id":"prt_02bef0e5e001GqqZ5D5ZAQGetT","messageID":"msg_02bef0bac001247e5Gfml1JlMz","sessionID":"ses_fd41153a5ffelEronWM5wISfOh","type":"text","text":"All 10 tests pass (4 committed + 6 added).\n\n**Design**\n- `summarize-assistants.mjs`: Filters eligible runs (`complete`/`pass`/`comparison_eligible !== false`), validates eligible records (non-empty strings, score 0–100 finite, elapsed >= 0), groups by exact assistant, picks best run (score → lower elapsed → lexicographic run_id), computes numeric-sorted median (averaging middle two on even count), and sorts by assistant without mutating input.\n- `render-comparison-table.mjs`: Validates array + required typed fields, preserves order, emits the exact header/delimiter, renders median ms as seconds with three decimals, escapes `|`, and emits the blank-line empty state.\n\n## Edge cases covered by my tests\n- Non-array `runs` throws `TypeError`; invalid eligible fields (missing run_id, score 150, negative elapsed, NaN score) throw.\n- Ineligible runs skip validation entirely (bad fields tolerated).\n- Median, tie-breaking by elapsed time, run_count, and no input mutation, plus stable sort order.\n- `renderComparisonTable` rejects missing/invalid summary fields and renders three-decimal seconds with escaped `|`.\n\n## Verification\n`node --test` on both suites: **10 pass, 0 fail**. Only the three named files were changed; the committed `comparison-summary.test.mjs` suite is untouched.","time":{"start":1787443482206,"end":1787443483432}}}
